  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Native.Integrated.EndPoint v2.0.5\n\nThe OASIS Native Integrated EndPoint lets you embed the complete OASIS engine (all managers, providers, HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture) directly into any .NET 10 application, game, or service -- no REST API or separate server required. Ideal for Unity games, desktop apps, and microservices that need direct in-process access to the Avatar/Karma/Holon/Data APIs across 55+ providers. Part of the OASIS Omniverse at https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.4\n- Initial validated package contents and metadata for this release line.\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Native EndPoint/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Native.Integrated.EndPoint",
